{"seq":3,"slug":"reactive-streams-spec","title":"Reactive Streams 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/reactive-streams-spec","wordCount":657,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"reactive-streams-规范\">Reactive Streams 规范</h1><p>Reactive Streams 是一个跨语言的<strong>异步数据流处理标准</strong>，于 2013 年由 Netflix、Pivotal、Lightbend 等公司联合制定，2017 年 Java 9 将其核心接口纳入标准库（<code>java.util.concurrent.Flow</code>）。规范的核心目标：<strong>在不同库、不同语言之间互通，同时通过背压协议防止快速生产者压垮慢速消费者</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>规范定义了四个接口和一套严格的交互协议：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Publisher: 数据生产者，按需发布 N 个数据项（0 ≤ N ≤ Long.MAX_VALUE）&#10;public interface Publisher&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    void subscribe(Subscriber&lt;? super T&gt; subscriber);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Subscriber: 数据消费者，通过背压信号控制接收速率&#10;public interface Subscriber&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    void onSubscribe(Subscription s);   // 订阅建立，获得 Subscription&#10;    void onNext(T t);                    // 收到数据项&#10;    void onError(Throwable t);           // 错误终止（互斥 onComplete）&#10;    void onComplete();                   // 正常终止（互斥 onError）&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Subscription: Publisher ↔ Subscriber 的通信通道&#10;public interface Subscription {&#10;    void request(long n);   // Subscriber 请求 n 个数据项（背压核心）&#10;    void cancel();           // Subscriber 取消订阅&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Processor: 既是 Publisher 又是 Subscriber，用于中间变换&#10;public interface Processor&lt;T, R&gt; extends Subscriber&lt;T&gt;, Publisher&lt;R&gt; {}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Publisher: 数据生产者，按需发布 N 个数据项（0 ≤ N ≤ Long.MAX_VALUE）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Publisher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Subscriber&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> super</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Subscriber: 数据消费者，通过背压信号控制接收速率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onSubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Subscription </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 订阅建立，获得 Subscription</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(T </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 收到数据项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Throwable </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误终止（互斥 onComplete）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onComplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正常终止（互斥 onError）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Subscription: Publisher ↔ Subscriber 的通信通道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Subscriber 请求 n 个数据项（背压核心）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Subscriber 取消订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Processor: 既是 Publisher 又是 Subscriber，用于中间变换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Processor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publisher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四者的关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as Publisher&#10;    participant S as Subscriber&#10;    participant Sub as Subscription&#10;&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;P: subscribe(S)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onSubscribe(Sub)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;Sub: request(3)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item1)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item2)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item3)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;Sub: request(2)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item4)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item5)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;S: onComplete()\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as Publisher\n    participant S as Subscriber\n    participant Sub as Subscription\n\n    S-&gt;&gt;P: subscribe(S)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onSubscribe(Sub)\n    S-&gt;&gt;Sub: request(3)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item1)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item2)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item3)\n    S-&gt;&gt;Sub: request(2)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item4)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onNext(item5)\n    P-&gt;&gt;S: onComplete()</pre><h2 id=\"背压协议详解\">背压协议详解</h2><p>背压（Backpressure）是 Reactive Streams 规范的<strong>存在意义</strong>。没有背压，快速生产者会向内存中塞满未消费的数据，最终 OOM。</p>\n<p>协议规则（来自规范 §1）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则编号</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.1</td>\n<td>Publisher 总计发送的 <code>onNext</code> 数不超过 Subscriber 通过 <code>request</code> 请求的总数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>Publisher 可以发送少于请求数量的数据，然后用 <code>onComplete</code> 或 <code>onError</code> 终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.9</td>\n<td><code>subscribe</code> 必须正常返回，即使 Publisher 决定拒绝；拒绝通过 <code>onError</code> 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.1</td>\n<td>Subscriber 必须通过 <code>Subscription.request(n)</code> 发出需求信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.7</td>\n<td>Subscriber 必须能处理同步的 <code>onNext</code> 调用（在 <code>request</code> 返回前就被调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.2</td>\n<td><code>Subscription.request</code> 不得引发 <code>onError</code>（必须通过 <code>onError</code> 信道报告错误）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 正确实现背压的 Subscriber 示例&#10;public class BatchSubscriber&lt;T&gt; implements Subscriber&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    private Subscription subscription;&#10;    private final int batchSize = 10;&#10;    private int count = 0;&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void onSubscribe(Subscription s) {&#10;        this.subscription = s;&#10;        s.request(batchSize);  // 初始请求 10 个&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public void onNext(T item) {&#10;        process(item);&#10;        count++;&#10;        if (count % batchSize == 0) {&#10;            subscription.request(batchSize);  // 处理完一批，再请求下一批&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override public void onError(Throwable t)  { handleError(t); }&#10;    @Override public void onComplete()           { finish(); }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确实现背压的 Subscriber 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BatchSubscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Subscription subscription;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batchSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onSubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Subscription </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.subscription </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batchSize);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 初始请求 10 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(T </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batchSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            subscription.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batchSize);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 处理完一批，再请求下一批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Throwable </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onComplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()           { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">finish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"publisher-的三种类型\">Publisher 的三种类型</h2><p>规范不限定 Publisher 的数据来源，但实践中有三类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 1. Cold Publisher: 每个 Subscriber 从头独立接收完整数据&#10;//    例：Reactor 的 Flux.fromIterable()，每次 subscribe 重新读取数据&#10;Flux&lt;Integer&gt; coldFlux = Flux.fromIterable(Arrays.asList(1, 2, 3, 4, 5));&#10;// 订阅 A 和 订阅 B 各自独立收到 1,2,3,4,5&#10;&#10;// 2. Hot Publisher: 多个 Subscriber 共享同一数据流，新订阅者错过历史数据&#10;//    例：Reactor 的 Sinks.many().multicast()&#10;Sinks.Many&lt;String&gt; sink = Sinks.many().multicast().onBackpressureBuffer();&#10;Flux&lt;String&gt; hotFlux = sink.asFlux();&#10;// 先订阅的 A 和后订阅的 B 会收到不同的数据（B 错过 sink.tryEmitNext() 之前的数据）&#10;&#10;// 3. Unicast Publisher: 严格只允许一个 Subscriber&#10;Sinks.Many&lt;String&gt; unicastSink = Sinks.many().unicast().onBackpressureBuffer();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. Cold Publisher: 每个 Subscriber 从头独立接收完整数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//    例：Reactor 的 Flux.fromIterable()，每次 subscribe 重新读取数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Flux&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> coldFlux </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Flux.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromIterable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Arrays.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">asList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 订阅 A 和 订阅 B 各自独立收到 1,2,3,4,5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span cla