\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Throwable </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  { downstream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onComplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()           { downstream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onComplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实践中几乎不需要手写 Processor——Reactor/RxJava 已提供完整的操作符链（<code>map</code>、<code>filter</code>、<code>flatMap</code> 等），它们内部就是 Processor 实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tck-合规性测试\">TCK 合规性测试</h2><p>Reactive Streams 提供了<strong>技术兼容性工具包</strong>（TCK，Technology Compatibility Kit），用于验证实现是否严格遵循规范。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 用 TestNG 运行 TCK 测试&#10;import org.reactivestreams.tck.PublisherVerification;&#10;import org.reactivestreams.tck.TestEnvironment;&#10;&#10;public class MyPublisherTest&#10;    extends PublisherVerification&lt;Integer&gt; {&#10;&#10;    public MyPublisherTest() {&#10;        super(new TestEnvironment(200 /* ms timeout */));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public Publisher&lt;Integer&gt; createPublisher(long elements) {&#10;        return new MyPublisher(elements);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Override&#10;    public Publisher&lt;Integer&gt; createFailedPublisher() {&#10;        return subscriber -&gt; subscriber.onSubscribe(&#10;            new Subscription() {&#10;                public void request(long n) {&#10;                    subscriber.onError(new RuntimeException(&quot;failed&quot;));&#10;                }&#10;                public void cancel() {}&#10;            }&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用 TestNG 运行 TCK 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> org.reactivestreams.tck.PublisherVerification;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> org.reactivestreams.tck.TestEnvironment;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyPublisherTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PublisherVerification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyPublisherTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestEnvironment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> /* ms timeout */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Publisher&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createPublisher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> elements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyPublisher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(elements);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Publisher&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createFailedPublisher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscriber.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onSubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    subscriber.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RuntimeException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TCK 包含 100+ 个测试用例，覆盖：背压信号传递、取消后不再发送数据、<code>onError</code>/<code>onComplete</code> 后不再调用 <code>onNext</code>、并发安全性等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Reactive Streams 定义了 4 个接口：<strong>Publisher</strong>（生产者）、<strong>Subscriber</strong>（消费者）、<strong>Subscription</strong>（通信通道）、<strong>Processor</strong>（中间变换）</li>\n<li><strong>背压协议</strong>是规范的核心：Subscriber 通过 <code>request(n)</code> 主动拉取，Publisher 绝不发送超过请求数量的数据</li>\n<li>Cold Publisher 每次订阅从头开始；Hot Publisher 共享实时数据流；Unicast 仅支持单订阅者</li>\n<li><code>java.util.concurrent.Flow</code> 是 Java 9 对 Reactive Streams 接口的官方采纳，语义完全一致</li>\n<li>TCK 测试套件保证不同实现间的互通性</li>\n<li>Reactor（Spring WebFlux）、RxJava 2/3、Akka Streams 都是 Reactive Streams 规范的合规实现</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Reactive Streams))&#10;    接口&#10;      Publisher&#10;      Subscriber&#10;      Subscription&#10;      Processor&#10;    背压协议&#10;      request(n)&#10;      不超发&#10;      协作流控&#10;    Publisher类型&#10;      Cold 独立重放&#10;      Hot 共享实时&#10;      Unicast 单订阅&#10;    合规实现&#10;      Reactor&#10;      RxJava&#10;      Akka Streams&#10;      Java Flow API\">mindmap\n  root((Reactive Streams))\n    接口\n      Publisher\n      Subscriber\n      Subscription\n      Processor\n    背压协议\n      request(n)\n      不超发\n      协作流控\n    Publisher类型\n      Cold 独立重放\n      Hot 共享实时\n      Unicast 单订阅\n    合规实现\n      Reactor\n      RxJava\n      Akka Streams\n      Java Flow API</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Reactive Streams 规范","id":"reactive-streams-规范"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"背压协议详解","id":"背压协议详解"},{"level":2,"text":"Publisher 的三种类型","id":"publisher-的三种类型"},{"level":2,"text":"Processor 与变换链","id":"processor-与变换链"},{"level":2,"text":"TCK 合规性测试","id":"tck-合规性测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信号、行为与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/foundations/signals-behaviors-events"},"next":{"title":"RxJS 与 Observable","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations/rxjs-observable"}}